+ * defined at the bottom of this file -- the PTHREAD backend statically
+ * initializes them and MBEDTLS_THREADING_ALT initializes them from
+ * mbedtls_threading_set_alt(). So this backend has to statically initialize
+ * them too, or every lock on them fails with a usage error.
